      "Original": "Hides the custom countdown under 5 to prevent overlapping with the vanilla one.",
      "Container": "EngageTimer.Properties.Strings.resources",
      "Key": "Settings_CountdownTab_DefaultOriginalCountDown_Help",
      "Translated": "倒计时小于 5 秒时隐藏自定义显示，以免与游戏原生倒计时重叠。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
